sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client (CLI/SDK)
    participant Gateway as OpenShell Gateway<br/>8080/TCP gRPC<br/>TLS 1.2+
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Supervisor as Supervisor<br/>5500/TCP gRPC<br/>mTLS
    participant Sandbox as Sandbox Binary<br/>2222/TCP SSH
    participant Upstream as Upstream AI Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 1: Sandbox Creation (Kubernetes)
    Client->>Gateway: CreateSandbox (gRPC)<br/>Auth: Bearer/OIDC
    Gateway->>K8sAPI: Create Pod + ServiceAccount<br/>Auth: SA Token
    K8sAPI-->>Gateway: Pod scheduled
    Gateway->>Supervisor: Initialize sandbox (gRPC)<br/>Auth: Gateway-issued mTLS cert
    Supervisor->>Sandbox: Setup via Sandbox Protocol (UDS)<br/>Auth: None (local)
    Sandbox-->>Supervisor: Ready
    Supervisor-->>Gateway: Sandbox initialized
    Gateway-->>Client: SandboxCreated response

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 2: Agent Network Request (Proxied)
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Sandbox->>Sandbox: Agent issues network request<br/>Intercepted via seccomp
        Sandbox->>Supervisor: Forward request (gRPC/mTLS)<br/>via boundary port 5500
        Supervisor->>Supervisor: Policy evaluation<br/>(regorus OPA engine)
        alt Policy allows
            Supervisor->>Upstream: HTTPS request<br/>Auth: Injected credentials<br/>(AWS SigV4 / API key)
            Upstream-->>Supervisor: Response
            Supervisor-->>Sandbox: Proxied response
        else Policy denies
            Supervisor-->>Sandbox: PolicyDenied error
        end
    end

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 3: SSH Session
    Client->>Gateway: SSH tunnel request (gRPC)<br/>Auth: Bearer/OIDC
    Gateway->>Sandbox: SSH connection (2222/TCP)<br/>Auth: Sandbox token
    Sandbox-->>Gateway: SSH session established
    Gateway-->>Client: Interactive session<br/>(streamed via gRPC)
